' @startuml Browser Token Flow <<Seqence Diagram>>

' actor User
' participant Browser
' participant Angular

' participant nginx
' ' participant oauth2Proxy
' participant Keycloak

' participant NodeJS as "Node.js BFF"
' participant RedisSession as "Session Store"
' participant Redis
' participant FHIR

' ' participant RevocationService




' ==User Registration Flow==
' User -> Browser : Registration request 
' Browser -> Angular : Input registration details in custom form
' Angular -> NodeJS : POST /auth/register with credentials
' NodeJS -> Keycloak : Create user via Admin API
' Keycloak -> NodeJS : User created
' NodeJS -> FHIR : Create user profile resource
' FHIR -> NodeJS : Acknowledgment
' NodeJS -> Keycloak : Auto-login with password grant
' Keycloak -> NodeJS : Access token, Refresh token, ID token
' NodeJS -> RedisSession : Store tokens in Redis session
' NodeJS -> Angular : Return user info + set session cookie
' ' Browser -> Angular :  success response
' Angular -> Browser : Set session cookie
' Angular -> Angular : Auto-redirect to dashboard
' Angular -> Browser : Display main page
' Browser -> User : Display main page
' ' Browser -> Keycloak : Registration request from sign in page
' ' Keycloak -> Browser : Redirect to registration page
' ' Browser -> Keycloak : Submit registration details
' ' Keycloak -> Keycloak : Create user account
' ' Keycloak -> Browser : Registration successful, redirect to main page
' ' Browser -> User : Display form to complete profile data



' ' == Complete Profile Data ==
' ' User -> Browser : Fill in profile data form
' ' Browser -> Angular : Submit profile data
' ' Angular -> nginx : Submit profile data with session cookie
' ' nginx -> NodeJS : Forward profile data
' ' NodeJS -> FHIR : Create user profile resource
' ' FHIR -> NodeJS : Acknowledge profile creation
' ' NodeJS -> nginx : Acknowledge profile data saved
' ' nginx -> Angular : display Confirmation
' ' Angular -> Browser : Display dashboard
' ' Browser -> User : Display main page


' == User Login Flow ==
' Browser -> Angular : Input credentials in custom login form
' Angular -> NodeJS : POST /auth/login with email/password
' NodeJS -> Keycloak : Authenticate via password grant
' Keycloak -> NodeJS : Access token, Refresh token, ID token
' NodeJS -> RedisSession : Store tokens in Redis session
' NodeJS -> Browser : Return user info + set session cookie
' Angular -> Browser : Receive success response
' Angular -> Browser : Redirect to dashboard
' Browser -> User : Display main page
' ' User -> Browser : Login request
' ' Browser -> nginx : Authentication request from frontend app

' ' ' nginx -> Keycloak : Redirect 
' ' ' Keycloak -> Browser : Authorization code (Authz code Flow)
' ' ' Browser -> nginx : GET /callback with Authz code
' ' ' nginx -> NodeJS : Authentication request with Authz code
' ' ' NodeJS -> Keycloak : exchange code for tokens
' ' ' Keycloak -> NodeJS : Access token , Refresh token , ID token
' ' ' NodeJS -> NodeJS : validate tokens
' ' ' NodeJS -> nginx : valid session

' ' nginx -> oauth2Proxy : Redirect to /oauth2/start
' ' oauth2Proxy -> Keycloak : Request Authorization code
' ' Keycloak -> Browser : Authorization code (Authz code Flow)
' ' Browser -> nginx : GET /oauth2/callback with Authz code
' ' nginx -> oauth2Proxy : callback with Authz code
' ' oauth2Proxy -> Keycloak : exchange code for tokens
' ' oauth2Proxy -> oauth2Proxy : store session cookie
' ' oauth2Proxy -> nginx : return authorization headers , set session cookie
' ' ' nginx -> NodeJs : proxy request with authorization headers



' ' ' NodeJS -> FHIR : forward Authorization
' ' ' FHIR -> NodeJS : resource
' ' nginx -> Browser : redirect to main page
' ' Browser -> User : display main page

' == User Action Requiring Data (API Call) ==

' User -> Browser : Action that needs Data
' Browser -> Angular : Forward Action
' alt Session cookie present
' Angular -> nginx : API call with session cookie
' nginx -> NodeJS : Forward request with session
' NodeJS -> NodeJS : Validate session and tokens
'     alt Access token expired (within 30sec of expiry)
'         NodeJS -> Keycloak : Refresh tokens using refresh token
'         Keycloak -> NodeJS : New Access token, Refresh token
'         NodeJS -> RedisSession : Update Redis session with new tokens
'     end
'     alt Resource available in cache
'         NodeJS -> Redis : Get resource from cache
'         Redis -> NodeJS : Resource
'     else Resource not in cache
'         NodeJS -> FHIR : Request resource with Access token
'         FHIR -> NodeJS : Resource
'         NodeJS -> Redis : Store resource in cache
'         Redis -> NodeJS : Ack
' ' Browser -> nginx : API call with session cookie
' ' nginx -> oauth2Proxy : validate session cookie
' ' alt session cookie expired
' ' oauth2Proxy -> Keycloak : use refresh token to get new tokens
' ' Keycloak -> oauth2Proxy : new Access token , new Refresh token , new ID token
' ' oauth2Proxy -> oauth2Proxy : update session cookie
' ' end
' ' oauth2Proxy -> nginx : return access token
' ' nginx -> NodeJS : forward request with access token
' '     alt resource available in cache
' '         NodeJS -> Redis : get resource from cache
' '         Redis -> NodeJS : resource
' '     else resource not in cache
' '         NodeJS -> FHIR : request resource with Access token
' '         FHIR -> NodeJS : resource
' '         NodeJS -> Redis : store resource in cache
' '         Redis -> NodeJS : ack
'     end
' NodeJS -> nginx : Response containing data
' nginx -> Angular : Response
' Angular -> Browser : Display data
' Browser -> User : Display updated content

' else No session cookie
' nginx -> NodeJS : Request without session
' NodeJS -> Angular : 401 Unauthorized
' Angular -> Browser : Redirect to /login
' Browser -> User : Prompt to login again (User Login Flow)
' end

' == Check Auth Status ==
' Angular -> NodeJS : GET /auth/me
' alt Session exists and valid
' NodeJS -> Angular : Return authenticated: true, user info
' Angular -> Angular : Update user state
' else Session expired or missing
' NodeJS -> Angular : Return authenticated: false
' Angular -> Angular : Clear user state
' Angular -> Browser : Redirect to login
' end

' == Logout Flow (Per-session) ==
' User -> Browser : Click "Sign out"
' Browser ->  Angular : Initiate logout
' Angular -> NodeJS : POST /auth/logout 
' NodeJS -> RedisSession : Destroy session
' NodeJS -> Keycloak : Revoke token for current session
' NodeJS -> Angular : Return logout URL
' Angular -> Browser : Clear local state
' Angular -> Browser : Redirect to /login
' Browser -> User : Display login page


' == Logout Flow (Global) ==
' User -> Browser : Click "Logout of all devices"
' Browser ->  Angular : Initiate global logout
' Angular -> NodeJS : POST /auth/logout-global
' ' Browser -> nginx : POST /auth/logout-global
' ' nginx -> NodeJS : /auth/logout -> call RevocationService (global)
' NodeJS ->  Keycloak : Admin logout user (invalidate refresh tokens / sessions)
' NodeJS -> RedisSession : DEL keys matching user sessions 
' ' RedisSession -> NodeJS : 200 OK
' NodeJS -> Angular : Logout complete
' Angular -> Browser : Clear state and redirect to /login
' Browser -> User : Display login page
' ' NodeJS -> Browser : redirect to '/'
' ' Browser -> oauth2Proxy : (old cookies invalid) /oauth2/auth -> requires login
' @enduml

